  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudm&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r programmet &#xE4;r bl a att assistera sm&#xE5;b&#xF6;nder som f&#xF6;rloratsin produktionskapacitet pga torka eller &#xF6;versv&#xE4;mningar, att &#xE5;terupptasin produktion. Uppmuntra diversifisering av gr&#xF6;dor och inf&#xF6;rande av conservation farming metoder f&#xF6;r b&#xE4;rkraftig livsmedelss&#xE4;kerhet. 1999/200 &#xE4;r utfasningsperiod.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the programme is e.a.:Assist to bring back into pro-duction small-scale farmers that lost their productive capacity as a result of recurrent drought and floods. Encourage crop diversificationand conservation farming methods for sustainabe household food security. 1999/2000 is the phasing out period.</narrative>
  </description>
